{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqiubpfgw48","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Rigging guard 'cold must fail before warm runs' is the honesty mechanism — it killed 3 trap classes","summary":"Every held-out experiment requires the cold arm to genuinely fail before a warm win can be claimed. This guard caught wincase-c, silent-cap, and all four Phase 1 traps as false wins (cold solved them by reading the committed oracle). Eight nulls plus guard discipline is WHY the two real wins are believable — the failure modes are the trust mechanism, not embarrassments to bury.","created_by":null,"valid_from":"2026-06-18T01:47:56.668Z","vec":[-0.08810658007860184,0.06100832298398018,0.02536550723016262,0.08469164371490479,0.05003281682729721,0.03439696505665779,0.06525261700153351,-0.021113982424139977,-0.034732695668935776,0.05405726656317711,-0.02691069431602955,-0.0028106195386499166,0.1158212199807167,-0.006542640272527933,0.0228806771337986,0.0018047007033601403,-0.00031768245389685035,0.012598065659403801,-0.011606954038143158,0.022652870044112206,0.012844329699873924,-0.04836723953485489,-0.039025288075208664,-0.01138424500823021,-0.06660624593496323,-0.05989978834986687,-0.071865014731884,-0.014911600388586521,-0.040557537227869034,-0.010064898990094662,-0.10716328769922256,-0.03247120603919029,-0.06074836850166321,-0.01306062936782837,-0.033695753663778305,0.07686211168766022,-0.018622877076268196,-0.029319485649466515,-0.1158677339553833,0.0508141815662384,0.05398772284388542,-0.024666234850883484,0.04400147870182991,0.0218212828040123,-0.02761065773665905,0.05827411264181137,-0.011508854106068611,0.013355406932532787,-0.03595932945609093,-0.09436272829771042,-0.10091616213321686,0.05660673603415489,0.04187224060297012,0.06807005405426025,-0.03318873420357704,-0.003064345335587859,0.011282986029982567,-0.024678697809576988,-0.03289750963449478,0.03789970651268959,0.053937576711177826,0.03124547004699707,-0.06368719786405563,-0.027276456356048584,0.08540382236242294,-0